+## v1.0.6.23 PR-06 Workflow State Persistence + Atomic Switch / Restart
+
+One active built-in workflow is now persisted in a schema-v1 state file and switched only through a fail-closed atomic transaction. Existing installations migrate to `share_invite` only when state is absent. No Workflow showcase UI or second production workflow is introduced.
+
+See `updates/v1.0.6.23-pr06-workflow-state-atomic-switch.md` and `verification/V1.0.6.23_PR06_WORKFLOW_STATE_ATOMIC_SWITCH.md`.
+
 ## v1.0.6.22 PR-05 Master Workflow Gate
 
